---
// Download component with platform-specific download buttons
---

<section id="download" class="py-20 bg-gray-900">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Descarrega l'aplicació</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Disponible per a Windows, macOS i Linux. Tria la teva plataforma i comença a gestionar els teus esdeveniments avui mateix.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Windows -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-750 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-900/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-blue-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M0 3.449L9.75 2.1v9.451H0m10.949-9.602L24 0v11.4H10.949M0 12.6h9.75v9.451L0 20.699M10.949 12.6H24V24l-12.9-1.801"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Per a Windows</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">Windows 10/11 (64-bit)</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal/releases/latest/download/GestorEvents-Setup.exe" 
            class="inline-block w-full px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
          >
            Descarregar per a Windows
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">.exe - Instal·lador</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-yellow-400 mt-2">⚠️ Podeu veure un avís de seguretat de Windows</p>
        </div>

        <!-- macOS -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-750 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-900/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-blue-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.85 1.5-3.41 1.5-1.34 0-2.34-.3-3.3-.8-1.03-.5-1.97-.8-3.2-.8-1.26 0-2.36.3-3.5.8v-.63c1.1-.55 1.92-1.3 2.5-2.2.58-.9.88-1.87.88-2.9 0-.54-.1-1.06-.3-1.5-.2-.45-.5-.9-.9-1.3-.4-.4-.85-.7-1.3-.9-.44-.2-.96-.3-1.5-.3-.27 0-.5.03-.7.08.06-1.1.5-2.05 1.3-2.9.8-.85 1.7-1.33 2.7-1.43 1.1-.1 2.1.3 2.9.8.8.5 1.2 1.2 1.8 1.2.6 0 1.1-.7 1.8-1.2 1.1-.8 2.5-1.2 3.9-1.1 1.5.1 2.7.8 3.5 1.8-1.4.8-2.1 2.1-2.1 3.9 0 1.1.3 2.1.9 3 .6.9 1.4 1.5 2.4 1.8-.1.4-.2.6-.3.8zM12 2c0 .9-.3 2.1-1.1 3.2-.8 1.1-1.8 1.8-2.9 1.7-.1-.8.3-2 .9-2.9.6-1 1.6-1.7 2.5-1.7.1 0 .1.1.1.1V2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Per a macOS</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">macOS 10.15 o superior</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal/releases/latest/download/GestorEvents.dmg" 
            class="inline-block w-full px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
          >
            Descarregar per a macOS
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">.dmg - Imatge de disc</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-yellow-400 mt-2">⚠️ Cal obrir des de Preferències del sistema després de la instal·lació</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Linux -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-750 transition-colors">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-900/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-blue-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M0 0v24h24V0zm19.295 5.386v1.64l-3.576 1.586v7.363l3.576 1.602v1.592L11 18.192l-7.285-3.607v-1.59l3.627-1.62v-7.38L3.62 7.026V5.414L11 9.263zm-4.948 3.929L7.866 9.77l2.166.981 2.12-.962zm-2.598 5.386l-2.166-.979v-4.955l2.166.981z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Per a Linux</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">.AppImage per a totes les distribucions</p>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal/releases/latest/download/GestorEvents.AppImage" 
            class="inline-block w-full px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors"
          >
            Descarregar per a Linux
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">.AppImage - Executable universal</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-yellow-400 mt-2">⚠️ Cal tenir instal·lat libfuse2</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 bg-gray-800/50 rounded-xl p-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Altres opcions de descàrrega</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal/releases/latest" 
            class="px-4 py-3 bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 4.42 2.865 8.167 6.839 9.49.5.092.682-.217.682-.482 0-.237-.008-.866-.013-1.7-2.782.603-3.369-1.34-3.369-1.34-.454-1.156-1.11-1.463-1.11-1.463-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.03 1.531 1.03.892 1.529 2.341 1.087 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.11-4.555-4.943 0-1.091.39-1.984 1.029-2.683-.103-.253-.446-1.27.098-2.647 0 0 .84-.269 2.75 1.025A9.578 9.578 0 0112 6.836c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.336 1.909-1.294 2.747-1.025 2.747-1.025.546 1.377.202 2.394.1 2.647.64.699 1.028 1.592 1.028 2.683 0 3.842-2.339 4.687-4.566 4.935.359.309.678.919.678 1.852 0 1.336-.012 2.415-.012 2.743 0 .267.18.578.688.48C19.138 20.163 22 16.416 22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10z"/>
            </svg>
            Veure totes les versions a GitHub
          </a>
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/Pepelocotango/Gestor-Events_i_Personal" 
            class="px-4 py-3 bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.477 2 12c0 4.42 2.865 8.167 6.839 9.49.5.092.682-.217.682-.482 0-.237-.008-.866-.013-1.7-2.782.603-3.369-1.34-3.369-1.34-.454-1.156-1.11-1.463-1.11-1.463-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.03 1.531 1.03.892 1.529 2.341 1.087 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.11-4.555-4.943 0-1.091.39-1.984 1.029-2.683-.103-.253-.446-1.27.098-2.647 0 0 .84-.269 2.75 1.025A9.578 9.578 0 0112 6.836c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.336 1.909-1.294 2.747-1.025 2.747-1.025.546 1.377.202 2.394.1 2.647.64.699 1.028 1.592 1.028 2.683 0 3.842-2.339 4.687-4.566 4.935.359.309.678.919.678 1.852 0 1.336-.012 2.415-.012 2.743 0 .267.18.578.688.48C19.138 20.163 22 16.416 22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10z"/>
            </svg>
            Codi font a GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
